# state: returning   (the golden disk's New001 profile: the title lists SELECT PROFILE first)
# Halo: Combat Evolved (4D530004), Nova: boot to the opening cinematic of The Pillar of Autumn
# and let it play, untouched (lane.halo1016, #938 #1018, 2026-10-16).
#
# Read from the route-frames of 0-1791083791-lanelocal-3030989 (halo-ce route, golden disk, 10-04),
# not guessed:
#   204215 booted: the main menu, CAMPAIGN lit (60 s after the route's start)
#   204221 after START: SELECT PROFILE, New001 lit
#   204226 after A: LOAD LEVEL, The Pillar of Autumn lit
#   204232 after START: CHOOSE DIFFICULTY, NORMAL lit
#   204239 after A: LOADING
#   204245 black; 204250 the cinematic (the ring in space)
# That route kept pressing START/A into the cinematic; this one presses nothing after the
# difficulty, so the cinematic plays as the owner watched it. The heavy shots (#1018) came
# ~90 s and ~150 s into it in the owner's capture (21:25:03-21:25:52 and 21:26:01-); the
# speech (#938) runs through all of it. `mark cinematic`, not `mark gameplay`: this is
# not play, and title_verdict's scored window must not read it as play.
wait 20
shot boot20
wait 20
shot boot40
wait 20
shot booted                 # CHECK: main menu, CAMPAIGN lit
press START
wait 5
shot profile                # CHECK: SELECT PROFILE, New001 lit
press A
wait 5
shot level                  # CHECK: LOAD LEVEL, The Pillar of Autumn
press START
wait 6
shot difficulty             # CHECK: CHOOSE DIFFICULTY, NORMAL lit
press A
wait 6
shot loading                # CHECK: LOADING
mark cinematic
repeat forever {
    wait 10
    shot cine
}
